<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Leisure Management 1996 net down.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Leisure Management 1996 net down.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     35.2    vs	39.3</p>
<p>    Net profit		 35.23   vs	39.33</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,970.15   vs   1,603.90</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   69.58   vs	86.39</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less 12.93   vs less 19.56</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   1.96   vs	 6.05</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)    6.0    vs	10.0</p>
<p>Note - Leisure Management Bhd is involved in gaming business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
